<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Barplats half yr attrib income flat, no div.</title>
<headline>Barplats half yr attrib income flat, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   0.1	   vs 0.1</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.2	   vs 0.1</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.1	   vs none</p>
<p>    Net expenditure	 0.1	   vs 0.1</p>
<p>    Financial income	0.3	   vs 0.2</p>
<p>Full name: Barplats Investments Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said no dividend had been declared. They said mining operations would not be resuscitated until reasonable and sustainable metal prices were achieved.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
